      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.1",
      "title": "Importance of aesthetics",
      "body": "● Armors and weapons aesthetics are very important for the fighters' appearance and sports representation. The development of our sport will be easier with well-maintained and properly finished armor and weapons.",
      "page_from": 3,
      "page_to": 3,
      "stable_key": "textile-and-leather:1.1",
