    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.3",
      "title": "Requirements",
      "body": "● Be based on historical sources.\n● Not be of a clearly modern color (I.E neon or fluorescent)\n● Be maintained in a good shape prior to any Buhurt International Event.\n● Not be decorated with modern images, offensive logos, etc.",
