    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "2.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Any material listed in 2.1 is allowed.\n● Any material based on historical sources thus not listed in 2.1 is allowed.\n● It is allowed to use a modern material under the following conditions:\n○ The modern material replicates the aesthetic of an approved material listed in 2.1 ○ The modern material is strong enough to endure full contact fights and to not be damaged too easily ○ We recommend asking for approval of Authenticity regarding modern materials before placing an order of an item made of such material.\n● Any clearly modern cloth element, such as underpants, sport legging, knee pad etc., must not be visible from any position.",
