    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Any natural leather is allowed.\n● It is allowed to use a modern material under the following conditions:\n○ The modern material replicates the aesthetic of natural leather.\n○ The modern material is strong enough to endure full contact fights and to not be damaged too easily.\n○ We recommend asking for approval of Authenticity regarding modern materials before placing an order of an item made of such material.\n● Specific requirements for boots and shoes ○ Boots and shoes must be based on historical sources.\n○ Boots and shoes must be fastened by leather laces, fabric laces or any historically plausible mechanism.",
